WEBVTT

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.820
65 Million Years Ago

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:35.300
Climber 1, separate!

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.250
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.150
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:25.920
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:30.770
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:37.000
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:41.090
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:45.790
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:49.750
It's time to launch!

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:52.930
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:52.930 --> 00:01:56.850
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:01.550
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:04.510
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:04.510 --> 00:02:07.430
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:10.180
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:10.390 --> 00:02:13.690
Pulverizing steel!

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:17.360
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:24.890
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:30.890
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:33.710
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:37.890
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:41.860
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:45.080
GenRyuJin, GouRyuJin

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.460
<i>GenRyuJin, GouRyuJin</i>

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.370
Something unimaginable has happened!

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:57.170
ChoRyuJin, who vanished into outer space in order to...

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:00.050
...save Earth from destruction by a giant meteor...

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:03.340
...has been discovered buried beneath 65-million-year-old strata!

00:03:04.890 --> 00:03:08.760
Meanwhile, the 31 Machine Primevals have appeared...

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.290
...in Egypt and Mexico after assimilating a pyramid.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:16.020
They are planning to transform themselves into Zonder Metal Plants.

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:23.640
But GaoGaiGar and the others have fallen for the enemy's trap...

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:25.940
...and have lost their ability to fight.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.510
Meanwhile, FuRyu and RaiRyu are in separate locations...

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:31.950
...each struggling in combat against the enemy.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.420
ChoRyuJin...

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:45.120
Please, lend us your power!

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.500
What on earth? This energy...

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.140
It's not from a G-Stone!

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:05.310
Wh-What just...

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:07.940
What just happened?

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.080
Ch-ChoRyuJin!

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.070
In Giza, Egypt, FuRyu...

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:33.670
...and in Chichen Izza, Mexico, RaiRyu are now in battle.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.880
Symmetrical Out!

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:45.380
To provide backup in two different locations simultaneously...

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:48.190
...we'll have to split up this time, right?

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:50.620
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:57.490
ChoRyuJin is back!

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:00.840
The Zonder Metal Plants in Egypt and Mexico!

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.470
After checking past data, there's no question that they've...

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.240
...entered the final stages of their plot!

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.580
No!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:10.010
That means all those people trapped inside...

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.910
...are going to be turned into Zonders!

00:05:13.350 --> 00:05:15.340
HyoRyu, EnRyu...

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:17.510
Just get there in time!

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.390
Big Brother EnRyu!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:31.330
Power Melting Gun!

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:48.680
What's that?

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:50.380
Power Freezing Gun!

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.420
Big Brother HyoRyu!

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.220
Come on, FuRyu!

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:57.260
Roger!

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:03.790
Too slow!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.390
Amazing, he's anticipating the enemy's moves!

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.740
Man, his body's gotten even more powerful than before!

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:17.640
But you were buried for 65 million years. How can that be?

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:19.110
I have no idea.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.580
All I know is that my body is...

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:24.850
...suffused with an unknown energy source that defies analysis.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.510
An unknown energy source?

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.810
That's right. We encountered it...

00:06:29.530 --> 00:06:30.750
That mysterious power...

00:06:30.990 --> 00:06:32.990
...called "Za Powa"!

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:41.630
Maximum output!

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:46.870
That day, we took on the colossal asteroid summoned by ZX-06...

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:50.870
...and we were able to push it to the other side of the ES Window.

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:54.550
But as a result, just before it was extinguished...

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:56.410
...the ES Window caused a bypass fluctuation...

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:59.320
...and the asteroid fell into the center of the planet Jupiter.

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.820
Normally, because of Za Powa's exclusion principle...

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.090
...HyoRyu and I would've been annihilated.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:16.930
The force of Za Powa pushed to the other side with a surge of energy...

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.940
...so strong it could pierce the ES Window.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:26.510
Thanks to the force of Za Powa, we were catapulted across space!

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:27.910
And in the next moment...

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.820
...miraculously, we had returned to the Earth's atmosphere.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:33.210
And what a sight we saw then...

00:07:33.960 --> 00:07:35.580
65 million years ago...

00:07:35.660 --> 00:07:38.150
...the Late Cretaceous Period, the time of the dinosaurs...

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:41.420
We had crossed over the light-years and all dimensions...

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.470
We had gone beyond time itself!

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:55.280
The dust and debris stirred up by the impact cut off all sunlight...

00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.540
Marking the start of a long winter...

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:01.240
And the dinosaurs were wiped out of existence.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.120
And we were sure to follow...

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.500
But it was our fervent wish...

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:21.760
We wanted to live...

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.900
We wished to survive and be reunited with you all...

00:08:24.970 --> 00:08:27.170
With all our might...

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:33.540
And our wish was granted by the residual energy inside us...

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:35.350
The energy of Za Powa!

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.750
And so we were resurrected!

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:40.690
The unknown energy source, "Za Powa"!

00:08:41.460 --> 00:08:45.090
The astonishing power to resurrect that which has fallen into decay!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:51.490
The Primevals' barrier is beginning to falter! Let's do it, FuRyu!

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:52.190
Roger!

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.540
Feng Dao Dan!

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:58.930
Chest Warmer!

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:03.340
Chest Thriller!

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:12.950
Rei!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.650
Not bad for inferior mechanical toys like you.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:30.800
You give us no choice. We'll take you on, then.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:40.380
Primeval Fusion!

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:54.860
Primeval Fusion!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.760
No way are we going to let you combine!

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.540
Are you all right, FuRyu?

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.100
Yes!

00:10:29.470 --> 00:10:31.590
Before we turn every last human being into Zonders...

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:33.790
...we're going to take care of you once and for all!

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.270
Take this!

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:51.680
Haven't you found GaoGaiGar and the others yet?

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:02.320
Susanoh, suicide attack!

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.200
What the!

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:16.640
Hyuuma!

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:21.480
Those fused Primevals are more or less a Zonder Plant in battle mode!

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:24.380
Their capacity for both offense and defense is immeasurable!

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.060
Chief! I'm getting a message from Mic!

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.320
Good news!

00:11:29.460 --> 00:11:31.720
I've found GaoGaiGar and the others!

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:43.070
If we go through Mic, we can restore communications.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.600
Good, make the connection!

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:45.500
Hey, guys!

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:47.410
Gai! So you survived!

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:51.340
Yeah, somehow. But I don't think I'll be able to move any time soon.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:55.010
Orbit Base! Can you hear the voice of yours truly?

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:57.850
Those unique sand crystals covering the machines...

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:00.790
...are causing the paralysis to their transmission networks.

00:12:00.960 --> 00:12:03.690
But have no fear, we've already started the analysis process.

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:06.420
Using Disc M to sync to that wavelength...

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.860
...we can remove the effects of the sand.

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:13.430
Just give me twenty... no, just give me ten more minutes!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:15.630
It's going to take another 10 minutes?

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.770
Somehow you've got to hold on, FuRyu, EnRyu!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.440
RaiRyu, HyoRyu!

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:29.880
The plant's almost finished.

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:32.680
At the rate we're going, we're not going to make it!

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.580
So I guess there's no choice but to do it, huh?

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:37.030
Symmetrical Docking!

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:41.330
Come on!

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:42.990
But listen, we can't just...

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:47.930
FuRyu and I. You and EnRyu. Basically we're all the same robot!

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:51.360
But they never programmed us to combine!

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:53.130
You know as well as I do...

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:56.040
We don't need some program to increase our SympaRate!

00:12:56.180 --> 00:12:57.940
But there will be some danger involved.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:00.380
Are you just gonna give up on the idea without even trying?

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.680
I'm sure you haven't forgotten!

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:07.920
Article 5, Section 125 of the GGG charter:

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:11.680
Under no circumstances should a member of GGG...

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:13.560
...ever give up!

00:13:14.030 --> 00:13:16.790
No question about it, we too are members of GGG!

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:20.560
And we're going to delete the term "give up" from our memory!

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.770
In that case, there's no reason to hesitate!

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:28.140
FuRyu, EnRyu, HyoRyu, RaiRyu...

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:31.480
Their SympaRates are rising. They're going right off the charts!

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:33.470
150...

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:35.410
160...

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:36.840
170...

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:38.310
175!

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.750
200 percent!

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.150
What on earth?

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:43.350
Hyo                                       HyoRyu

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:43.350
Rai                                        RaiRyu

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:46.260
Symmetrical Docking!

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:49.500
Symmetrical Docking!

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:11.450
GenRyuJin!

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:18.820
GouRyuJin!

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:22.020
Waha!

00:14:22.160 --> 00:14:22.960
Yahoo!

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:25.190
How absurd!

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:47.380
That won't have any effect on me.

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:57.820
I'm going to trap you inside my Micro Black Hole!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.660
Aurora Fusion!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:11.110
As if I could be fooled so easily! I'm going to inhale every last bit of you!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:19.010
Those are merely virtual images I created out of ice.

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:20.880
The real deal's right here!

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.460
Hey, you just dug your own grave!

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:45.980
GenRyuJin and GouRyuJin, that was awesome!

00:15:46.080 --> 00:15:47.950
Who knew they had powers like that!

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:53.010
Mic! My brother Liger's going to send you the program now!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.180
Let's hear you make some amazing music!

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:56.120
Okay!

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:58.290
C'mon, rock 'n' roll!

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:00.320
Disc M!

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:02.590
Set on!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.330
Yeah!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.950
All right! We succeeded!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.720
Hey, look over there!

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.830
You saved my butt!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:39.370
Thanks, Mic!

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.800
Yeah! This really rocks!

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:43.170
Big Brother Gai!

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:44.830
Are you all right, guys?

00:16:45.070 --> 00:16:45.700
Huh?

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:51.680
Don't tell me you rescued that one, too?

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:53.300
Oh! My mistake!

00:16:53.720 --> 00:16:54.680
Kaidou...

00:16:57.790 --> 00:16:58.880
Thank you...

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:00.150
...Latio.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:06.220
J! You better not be planning to get in our way again!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:10.500
I owe you one now. This time around, we're going to back you guys up.

00:17:11.030 --> 00:17:13.130
Jewel Generator, full blast!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.390
Roger!

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.670
All right! Come on you guys, let's go!

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:21.900
Right!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:25.840
Blow, ice and snow! Split the sky, lightning!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:28.820
Thunder Blizzard!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.860
Roar, Hurricane! Burn, scorching heat!

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:46.860
Burning Hurricane!

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:01.950
GouRyuJin! That was awesome!

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:03.680
I'm not beaten yet!

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:11.290
No! This will immobilize us again!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:18.200
That sandstorm of yours is totally useless now, man!

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:25.400
Impossible!

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:28.070
Goldion Hammer, activation approved!

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:29.270
Roger!

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:34.180
Goldion Hammer... Safety Device... Relieve!

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:45.330
Hammer Connect!

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:52.760
Goldion Hammer!

00:18:57.410 --> 00:18:58.740
King J-Der!

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:01.240
J-Quath!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.650
The J-Quath...

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:23.100
I never dreamed you'd come riding in on the J-Quath...

00:19:23.870 --> 00:19:26.130
Ikumi, please stop this nonsense.

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:28.800
You're not going to fool me twice with that same tactic.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:34.940
Hammer Hell!

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.540
Hammer Heaven!

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:46.580
Transform into light!

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:51.680
Disc X!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:53.850
Set on!

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:10.270
Antimeson Cannons!

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:18.480
The Zonder Metal Plant is about to be extinguished.

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.550
Now that was one hell of an experience.

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:27.920
Templum...

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:29.660
Mundus...

00:20:29.800 --> 00:20:31.060
Infini...

00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.630
Tum...

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:34.160
Redire!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:49.120
I'm glad you're safe...

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.180
Mother...

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:54.780
Curatio!

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:57.060
Teneritas!

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:58.560
Sectio!

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:00.090
Salus!

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.090
Coctura!

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:14.410
Good job, Special Agent Mamoru.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:15.600
Waha!

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.010
Mamoru, could you take care of this one, too?

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:18.770
Sure!

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:35.060
Where's the Primeval?

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:37.960
No good! He escaped!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:41.270
But I'm not getting any kind of Primeval reaction!

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:44.430
It's being blocked by this sandstorm he started!

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.070
Damn!

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:53.170
The strong bond of trust between them has allowed...

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:56.220
...GenRyuJin and GouRyuJin to achieve Symmetrical Docking.

00:21:56.850 --> 00:22:00.980
Two new heroes have been born, here and now!

00:22:06.500 --> 00:22:07.360
GouRyuJin!

00:22:07.660 --> 00:22:08.600
GenRyuJin!

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:17.690
We cannot control the force of Za Powa!

00:22:21.240 --> 00:22:22.180
What's that light?

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:23.980
It's the Light of Destruction!

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:28.680
What on earth is happening?

00:22:31.990 --> 00:22:34.110
Now detecting Za Powa.

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:38.020
Unlimited power. Point of existence...

00:22:38.190 --> 00:22:39.720
...Jupiter.

00:22:46.470 --> 00:22:50.370
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.570 --> 00:22:55.240
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:01.420
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.420 --> 00:23:06.210
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.840 --> 00:23:10.380
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:17.310
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:24.070
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:28.730
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.420 --> 00:23:34.070
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.070 --> 00:23:41.070
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:48.530
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.730 --> 00:23:50.820
In their relentless quest for a new kind of power...

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:53.830
...the 31 Machine Primevals have launched their final attack!

00:23:54.000 --> 00:23:56.840
A broadcast signal unknown to mankind is blasting itself across the globe!

00:23:57.370 --> 00:23:59.240
Now is the time for you to recover all that you hold dear!

00:23:59.310 --> 00:24:02.940
We're all waiting for you to wield that power of yours, Mamoru!

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:05.170
